cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Safe-Route: Explainable Risk Scoring for Infrastructure Safety Prioritization"
abstract: >-
  A working prototype that scores combinations of road and environmental
  conditions with a Random Forest model and explains each score with TreeSHAP,
  to help road engineers build a reviewable inspection shortlist. Trained on
  synthetic data (Kaggle Playground Series S5E10). Selected for presentation
  at the 4th International Conference on Smart Sustainable Development
  (SSD 2026) project showcase, project P21.
type: software
